# Medium on an opened fold's inner screen (MBUI_WIN=690x840 MBUI_FILM_PLATFORM=2): the chat's page brought over, its
# composer pressed (a box), a press on the messages (let go: a capsule again), pressed again: the box's ground goes
# from the shape it had to the new one, its foot where it is (docs/motion.md: moved or reshaped, for its cause).
system {"size_class":{"width":"medium","height":"medium"}}
timeout 20000
until 发消息
wait 600
tapxy -80 420
wait 900
tap 发消息
wait 900
tapxy -80 300
wait 1200
tap 发消息
wait 900
exit
